    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image containing a shoe, a ruler, scissors, and a carrot. The shoe is located on the left side of the image. Below the shoe is a ruler, below the ruler are the scissors, and below the scissors is a carrot. These four objects are aligned vertically. Additionally, the carrot is smaller than the shoe.",
